<title>UK: Goldsmiths sees results in line.</title>
<headline>Goldsmiths sees results in line.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British jewellery company Goldsmiths Group Plc said on Thursday its results to February 1, 1997 would be in line with market expectations.</p>
<p>The Leicester-based retail company said sales in the four weeks to December 28, 1996, rose 9.8 percent on a like-for-like basis from the year-earlier period.</p>
<p>Sales for the 11 months to December 28 were up 9.4 percent on a like-for-like basis.</p>
<p>The company said it would accelerate its shop-opening programme this year, when it planned more than 12 new branches.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
